{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSk7eWbo2xh71tFtiCz8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Problem:** Two annual customers got renewal reminders on dates that do not match their renewal dates. C-311 got one on October 19, 2026. C-327 got one on May 17, 2024, and their renewal was June 1, 2024.\n\n**Hypothesis:** The reminder date for an annual customer is not always the date that customer expects, given their renewal date. The current system can fail to give the expected date.\n\n**Falsifier:** Every annual customer in the export gets a reminder exactly 14 days before the renewal date they expect, and the two reported cases match that.\n\nThis wording leaves out the cause and the fix. I do not know yet whether the renewal date should come from billing, from the annual start, or from signup. I also do not know how the renewal date should behave around Feb 29. Those are questions for the decision, not part of the problem."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2284,"cache_read_input_tokens":44663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2284},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7bf991b5-845a-4341-b61f-5e6b815c36fa","uuid":"a27a77b1-c25a-4067-be8a-963a62a88a5f","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:30:11.108Z","request_id":"req_011CgSk7eGxvhLrez7YHNWFe"}
